// EASCape: the Wise Old Man's junk: quest items you no longer need once the quest is done. Void's
// wise_old_man_junk table (the 2011 game's list), kept to the quests we have and matched to our
// objs by id (each checked by name); noted copies are left out (ours). His own three books are
// always junk (2009scape's WiseOldManDialogue: "That's my book! What's it doing in your bank?").

[wom_junk_silverlight_key_1]
